>> Animal := Yam-khoom tshiab.
>> Factory := Yam-khoom tshiab.

Animal thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: {
	>> animal := tus-kheej tshiab.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal thaum-tuaj: ['sound:'] ua: { :s
	nws-li sound := s.
}.

Animal thaum-tuaj: ['sound'] ua: { <- nws-li sound.
}.

>> Dog := Yam-khoom tshiab.
>> Cat := Yam-khoom tshiab.

Dog thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: { <- Animal tshiab sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat thaum-tuaj: ['tshiab'] ua: { <- Animal tshiab sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Tawm sau-ntawv: Dog tshiab sound, kab-tshiab.
Tawm sau-ntawv: Cat tshiab sound, kab-tshiab.

Factory thaum-tuaj: ['mix:and:'] ua: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal tshiab sound: (
		( beast1 sound los-ntawm: 0 ntev: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound los-ntawm: 2 ntev: 5 )
	).
}.

Tawm sau-ntawv: (Factory mix: Dog tshiab and: Cat tshiab) sound, kab-tshiab.
